{\\text{d}x}+4x{e}^{x}=1$ that satisfies the condition $y(0)=7$ is\n\n$$\ny=-{e}^{-x}-2{x}^{2}+8.\n$$" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373533 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373534 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373533 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373535 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373533 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373536 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373533 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373537 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373533 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373538 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373533 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373533 1077 "selection" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373533 1079 #edb/ref 17592186373538 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373533 1080 #uuid "be7c8072-e10a-55ab-8358-3a565f0a6a95" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373534 1081 "y=-{e}^{-x}-4x+8" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373534 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373534 1084 #uuid "e0ba7021-278a-5bfc-8d11-f00a3b63b0b4" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373535 1081 "y={e}^{-x}-2{x}^{2}+6" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373535 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373535 1084 #uuid "0d863f80-974c-5fd0-9ba0-3d19bf8e3347" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373536 1081 "y={e}^{x}-4{x}^{2}+6" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373536 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373536 1084 #uuid "22f9d7b5-6e34-51ba-a04a-13901fa9651e" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373537 1081 "y={e}^{x}-2{x}^{2}+6" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373537 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373537 1084 #uuid "31b7712a-30c7-5b25-a8c1-60f541081385" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373538 1081 "y=-{e}^{-x}-2{x}^{2}+8" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373538 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373538 1084 #uuid "fc9220a2-0ad7-50c6-85ed-98e053e99e0b" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373539 1068 #edb/ref 17592186373540 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373539 1069 "q-104057" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373539 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373539 1071 "Find the particular solution to the differential equation $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+2x{e}^{-y}=3{x}^{2}{e}^{-y}$ that satisfies $y(1)=1.$" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373539 1072 #uuid "52066178-466b-57ba-8963-0e5e66a7bec7" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373539 1074 "We first find the general solution and then apply the given initial condition to find a particular solution.\n\nSeparating variables and integrating both sides with respect to $x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+2x{e}^{-y} & =3{x}^{2}{e}^{-y} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =3{x}^{2}{e}^{-y}-2x{e}^{-y} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =(3{x}^{2}-2x){e}^{-y} \\\\ {e}^{y}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =3{x}^{2}-2x \\\\ \\int {e}^{y}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int (3{x}^{2}-2x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int {e}^{y}\\,\\text{d}y & =\\int (3{x}^{2}-2x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ {e}^{y} & ={x}^{3}-{x}^{2}+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApplying the natural logarithm to both sides, we find the general solution:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{ln}⁡({e}^{y}) & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{3}-{x}^{2}+C) \\\\ y & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{3}-{x}^{2}+C)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe now apply the initial condition $y(1)=1$ to find $C:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y(1) & =1 \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡({1}^{3}-{1}^{2}+C) & =1 \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡C & =1 \\\\ C & =e\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus the particular solution of $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+2x{e}^{-y}=3{x}^{2}{e}^{-y}$ that satisfies the condition $y(1)=1$ is\n\n$$\ny=\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{3}-{x}^{2}+e).\n$$" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373540 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373541 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373540 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373542 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373540 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373543 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373540 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373544 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373540 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373545 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373540 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373540 1077 "selection" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373540 1079 #edb/ref 17592186373542 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373540 1080 #uuid "493ad9d4-8aff-5cd3-bb25-1648834bbb25" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373541 1081 "y=\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{3}-{x}^{2})" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373541 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373541 1084 #uuid "0ddf8e77-1f92-52ca-ba0f-d3a0c8aeeddd" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373542 1081 "y=\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{3}-{x}^{2}+e)" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373542 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373542 1084 #uuid "ddeef60e-4ec8-586c-a724-ac4e52f99051" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373543 1081 "y=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{{x}^{3}-{x}^{2}+2e}{2})" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373543 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373543 1084 #uuid "eaeab17a-7de9-520a-be72-1e945c3a28b3" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373544 1081 "y=\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+2x-3+e)" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373544 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373544 1084 #uuid "a08229ef-ec6b-54f8-8faf-e2cb18e885e7" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373545 1081 "y=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{e{x}^{2}+e}{2})" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373545 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373545 1084 #uuid "9474dc52-92f4-5600-a6ca-5868d826ebe0" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373546 1068 #edb/ref 17592186373547 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373546 1069 "q-107047" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373546 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373546 1071 "Consider a vector space $V$ and vectors ${v}_{1},{v}_{2},{v}_{3}\\in V.$ Given that ${{v}_{1},{v}_{2},{v}_{3}}$ is linearly independent, which of the following statements are true?\n\n- ${{v}_{1}-{v}_{2},{v}_{2}-{v}_{3},{v}_{1}-{v}_{3}}$ is linearly independent\n- ${{v}_{1},2{v}_{2},3{v}_{3}}$ is linearly independent\n- ${{v}_{1},{v}_{2},0}$ is linearly independent" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373546 1072 #uuid "3e3aa161-9904-5811-8bd5-9983d559a3c1" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373546 1074 "Let's examine each of the given options in turn.\n\n- Statement I is false. Indeed, notice that\n\n$$\n1\\cdot ({v}_{1}-{v}_{2})+1\\cdot ({v}_{2}-{v}_{3})+(-1)\\cdot ({v}_{1}-{v}_{3})=0.\n$$\n\nAs a result, ${x}_{1}({v}_{1}-{v}_{2})+{x}_{2}({v}_{2}-{v}_{3})+{x}_{3}({v}_{1}-{v}_{3})=0$ has a non-zero solution. This means that ${{v}_{1}-{v}_{2},{v}_{2}-{v}_{3},{v}_{1}-{v}_{3}}$ is linearly dependent.\n\n- Statement II is true. Suppose that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}{v}_{1}+{x}_{2}(2{v}_{2})+{x}_{3}(3{v}_{3}) & =0,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich, in turn, gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}{v}_{1}+2{x}_{2}{v}_{2}+3{x}_{3}{v}_{3} & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, since ${{v}_{1},{v}_{2},{v}_{3}}$ is a linearly independent set, the final equation can be true only if\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}=0 \\\\ 2{x}_{2}=0 \\\\ 3{x}_{3}=0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe unique solution of the system is ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}={x}_{3}=0,$ which means that \n\n$$\n{{v}_{1},2{v}_{2},3{v}_{3}}\n$$\n\n is linearly independent.\n\n- Statement III is false. Indeed, notice that \n\n$$\n0\\cdot {v}_{1}+0\\cdot {v}_{2}+1\\cdot 0=0.\n$$\n\nAs a result, ${x}_{1}{v}_{1}+{x}_{2}{v}_{2}+{x}_{3}0=0$ has a non-zero solution. This means that ${{v}_{1},{v}_{2},0}$ is linearly dependent. In general, any set containing the zero vector is linearly dependent.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\"" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373547 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373548 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373547 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373549 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373547 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373550 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373547 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373551 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373547 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373552 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373547 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373547 1077 "selection" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373547 1079 #edb/ref 17592186373552 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373547 1080 #uuid "eed24b82-e248-5d47-8d98-8441865e359f" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373548 1081 "I and III only" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373548 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373548 1084 #uuid "a6cd6819-3d4f-5d36-b01a-4a8f9b118206" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373549 1081 "I only" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373549 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373549 1084 #uuid "46169318-8608-5ab9-93d4-86318e8fbf87" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373550 1081 "III only" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373550 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373550 1084 #uuid "6c3f3711-3ac9-50b4-a9b8-6b639948d5fc" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373551 1081 "I and II only" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373551 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373551 1084 #uuid "5a1ab5bd-179e-5f8a-8a5d-aae8ab35ffb9" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373552 1081 "II only" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373552 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373552 1084 #uuid "86aa3e2a-3380-5ceb-893a-188da5e730ca" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373553 1068 #edb/ref 17592186373554 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373553 1069 "q-107560" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373553 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373553 1071 "Given that the expression $\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4x)-\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4x)$ can be written as $R\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4x-ϕ)$ with $R>0$, what is the value of $R?$" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373553 1072 #uuid "b88f22a6-3e89-5c57-879e-3270bef78dc8" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373553 1074 "The difference formula for sine gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}R\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4x-ϕ) & =R(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ) \\\\  & =R\\operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4x)-R\\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4x)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, by writing the given expression in the amplitude-phase form\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4x)-\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4x)=R\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4x-ϕ),\n$$\n\nwe get the following identity:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4x)-\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4x)=(R\\operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4x)-(R\\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4x)\n$$\n\nEquating the coefficients of $\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4x)$ and $\\operatorname{cos}⁡(4x),$ we get the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}R\\operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ=1 \\\\ R\\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ=\\sqrt{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSquaring the first and the second equations of the system and adding the results together, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(R\\operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ)}^{2}+{(R\\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ)}^{2} & ={1}^{2}+(\\sqrt{2})^{2} \\\\ {R}^{2}({cos}^{2}⁡ϕ+{sin}^{2}⁡ϕ) & =1+2 \\\\ {R}^{2} & =3 \\\\ R & =\\sqrt{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that we only consider the positive root since $R>0.$" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373554 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373555 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373554 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373556 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373554 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373557 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373554 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373558 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373554 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373559 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373554 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373554 1077 "selection" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373554 1079 #edb/ref 17592186373557 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373554 1080 #uuid "1d3eeca4-7415-531e-a550-48d658f20aaa" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373555 1081 "\\sqrt{2}" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373555 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373555 1084 #uuid "f5774a10-cb7f-5b41-887f-1520b6c58ab8" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373556 1081 "3" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373556 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373556 1084 #uuid "58df2a78-8669-57bd-8fe9-05bcf8800fe2" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373557 1081 "\\sqrt{3}" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373557 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373557 1084 #uuid "82a558c8-a886-5a86-b278-46cc7fc35494" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373558 1081 "\\sqrt{6}" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373558 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 