}_{1}$ and ${a}_{2}:$\n\n$$\nr=\\frac{{a}_{2}}{{a}_{1}}=\\frac{10}{5}=2\n$$\n\nNow we must determine $N$ (the index of the last term). To do this, we use the fact that\n\n$$\n{a}_{N}={a}_{1}\\cdot {r}^{N-1}.\n$$\n\nTherefore\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{N} & ={a}_{1}\\cdot {r}^{N-1} \\\\ 1\\,280 & =5\\cdot {2}^{N-1} \\\\ 256 & ={2}^{N-1} \\\\ {2}^{8} & ={2}^{N-1} \\\\ 8 & =N-1 \\\\ N & =9.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpressing the geometric series in sigma notation, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5+10+⋯+1\\,280 & ={\\sum }_{n=1}^{9}5\\cdot {2}^{n-1}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373589 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373590 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373589 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373591 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373589 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373592 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373589 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373593 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373589 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373594 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373589 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373589 1077 "selection" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373589 1079 #edb/ref 17592186373594 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373589 1080 #uuid "50b842ee-9ada-54c7-9580-066ace32be38" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373590 1081 "{\\sum }_{n=1}^{8}5\\cdot {2}^{n-1}" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373590 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373590 1084 #uuid "663ecbbe-2cd2-5d19-8aa4-c81be196aed2" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373591 1081 "{\\sum }_{n=1}^{8}2\\cdot {5}^{n-1}" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373591 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373591 1084 #uuid "923cdc45-b540-51d0-b57c-b26ef5a4f05c" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373592 1081 "{\\sum }_{n=1}^{10}5\\cdot {2}^{n-1}" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17