 \\\\  & =(u({1}^{2}),\\,{u}^{2}) &  \\\\  & =(u,\\,{u}^{2}), & 1\\ge u\\ge 0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis is an upward-opening parabola traversed from the point $(1,1)$ to the point $(0,0)$ in the $xy$-plane.\n\n- Consider the image of the side ${S}_{4}.$ Here, we have $u=0$ and $1\\ge v\\ge 0.$ Substituting $u=0$ into our transformation equations, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x,y) & =T(u,v) &  \\\\  & =(u{v}^{2},\\,{u}^{2}) &  \\\\  & =(0{v}^{2},\\,{0}^{2}) &  \\\\  & =(0,\\,0), & 1\\ge v\\ge 0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \nThis is the point $(0,0)$ in the $xy$-plane.\n\nDrawing the images of the sides of our square, we obtain the following image of $Δ:$\n\n![](images/64/648fa48df1bd648d9fbf48efc966698228416ad9bf3a0f69045031e955601d61.png)" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373909 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373910 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373909 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373911 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373909 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373912 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373909 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373913 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373909 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373914 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373909 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373909 1077 "selection" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373909 1079 #edb/ref 17592186373912 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373909 1080 #uuid "515b035c-875d-5a93-a2bf-bdd77d9642fd" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373910 1081 "images/72/72e271d6a2282fdf7cdf852308f569de848b8bdc71935e1487969f9ea7ac3eb0.png" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373910 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373910 1084 #uuid "3bd9f9d6-0406-5b60-bf3c-c7fb79ebaf40" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373911 1081 "images/e3/e3cfcf4c6cd7bcc8298a7e3d8c76f4add3f61689cecc1dacb9fa8a48db5a042b.png" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373911 