mpute the required integral, we can use the change of variables formula\n\n$$\n{∬}_{D}f(x,y)\\,dx\\,dy={∬}_{Δ}\\text{ }f(x(u,v),y(u,v))|\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}|du\\,dv\n$$\n\nwhere $\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}$ is the Jacobian determinant corresponding to $T.$\n\nNote that the change of variables\n\n$$\nu=\\frac{y}{{x}^{2}},\\,v=xy\n$$\n\n \ngives us the *inverse* function ${T}^{-1},$ that is\n\n$$\n{T}^{-1}:[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]\\to [\\begin{aligned}u(x,y) \\\\ v(x,y)\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTo compute the required integral, we proceed as follows::\n\n**Step 1**: Find $Δ,$ which is the image of $D$ under the action of ${T}^{-1}.$ \n\nOur domain in the $uv$-plane is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Δ & ={(u,v)\\,:\\,1\\le u\\le 4,\\,1\\le v\\le 5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Step 2**: Compute the Jacobian determinant corresponding to ${T}^{-1}:$\n\nThe Jacobian determinant corresponding to ${T}^{-1}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(u,v)}{∂(x,y)} & =|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂u}{∂x} & \\frac{∂u}{∂y} \\\\ \\frac{∂v}{∂x} & \\frac{∂v}{∂y}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{2y}{{x}^{3}} & \\frac{1}{{x}^{2}} \\\\ y & \\text{ }\\text{ }x\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =-\\frac{3y}{{x}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Step 3**: Compute the Jacobian determinant corresponding to $T:$\n\nThe Jacobian determinant corresponding to $T$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}={(\\frac{∂(u,v)}{∂(x,y)})}^{-1}=\\frac{1}{(-\\frac{3y}{{x}^{2}})}=-\\frac{1}{3u}.\n$$\n\nNote that $\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}\\ne 0$ everywhere inside $Δ.$ In other words, $T$ has no critical points inside $Δ.$\n\n**Step 4**: Perform the change of variables:\n\nPerforming the change of variables, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}xy\\,dx\\,dy & ={∬}_{Δ}v|\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}|\\text{d}u\\,\\text{d}v \\\\  & ={∬}_{Δ}v\\cdot |\\frac{1}{3u}|\\,\\text{d}u\\,\\text{d}v \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}{\\int }_{1}^{5}{\\int }_{1}^{4}\\frac{v}{u}\\,\\text{d}u\\,\\text{d}v \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}{\\int }_{1}^{5}v[{\\int }_{1}^{4}\\frac{1}{u}\\,\\text{d}u]\\text{d}v \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}{\\int }_{1}^{5}v[\\operatorname{ln}⁡|u|\\,{|}_{1}^{4}]dv \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}{\\int }_{1}^{5}v(\\operatorname{ln}⁡4-\\operatorname{ln}⁡1)\\,dv \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{3}{\\int }_{1}^{5}v\\,dv \\\\  & =\\frac{2\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{3}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}{v}^{2}\\,{|}_{1}^{5} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{ln}⁡2}{3}\\cdot (25-1) \\\\  & =8\\operatorname{ln}⁡2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373916 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373917 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373916 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373918 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373916 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373919 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373916 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373920 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373916 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373921 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373916 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373916 1077 "selection" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373916 1079 #edb/ref 17592186373921 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373916 1080 #uuid "d8dfde2a-78d4-5f4f-9dd7-f750b4f43d5c" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373917 1081 "\\frac{9}{2}" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373917 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373917 1084 #uuid "e344f475-3668-5c1f-9b88-0fa12f4ef4de" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373918 1081 "\\frac{11}{4}" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373918 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373918 1084 #uuid "17a3824c-bebc-5701-8d19-9114502785b4" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373919 1081 "3\\operatorname{ln}⁡2" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373919 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373919 1084 #uuid "bf4f6312-74e7-571d-b7fe-be323a268da2" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373920 1081 "6" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373920 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373920 1084 #uuid "22d2eda0-0d96-5f44-84d6-338243168c0b" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373921 1081 "8\\operatorname{ln}⁡2" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373921 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373921 1084 #uuid "fcec1dbc-cba7-5afe-82ab-ccf5f65b004f" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373922 1068 #edb/ref 17592186373923 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373922 1069 "q-160901" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373922 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373922 1071 "Use a change of variables to evaluate the double integral \n\n$$\n{∬}_{D}x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi (x+y))\\,dxdy,\n$$\n\nwhere $D$ is the quadrilateral region with vertices $(0,0),$ $(1,-1),$ $(1,0),$ and $(0,1).$" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373922 1072 #uuid "c887f553-5496-5423-9167-1a0440f8386c" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373922 1074 "Let's define a transformation $T$ as follows:\n\n$$\nT:[\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]⟶[\\begin{aligned}x(u,v) \\\\ y(u,v)\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThis transformation maps some region $Δ$ in the $uv$-plane to our region $D$ in the $xy$-plane.\n\nTo compute the required integral, we can use the change of variables formula\n\n$$\n{∬}_{D}f(x,y)\\text{ }dxdy={∬}_{Δ}\\text{ }f(x(u,v),y(u,v))\\,|\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}|\\text{ }dudv\n$$\n\nwhere $\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}$ is the Jacobian determinant corresponding to $T.$\n\nTo compute the required integral, we proceed as follows:\n\n**Step 1**: Find a suitable change of variables.\n\nThe integrand\n\n$$\nf(x,y)=x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi (x+y))\n$$\n\nsuggests that we use the change of variables \n\n$$\nu=x,\\,v=x+y.\n$$\n\nThis change of variables gives us the *inverse* function ${T}^{-1},$ that is\n\n$$\n{T}^{-1}:[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]\\to [\\begin{aligned}u(x,y) \\\\ v(x,y)\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\n**Step 2**: Find $Δ,$ which is the image of $D$ under the action of ${T}^{-1}.$ \n\nThe vertices of our domain $Δ$ in the $uv$-plane are as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{T}^{-1}(0,0) & =(0,0+0) \\\\  & =(0,0) \\\\ {T}^{-1}(1,-1) & =(1,1+(-1)) \\\\  & =(1,0) \\\\ {T}^{-1}(1,0) & =(1,1+0) \\\\  & =(1,1) \\\\ {T}^{-1}(0,1) & =(0,0+1) \\\\  & =(0,1)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, our domain in the $uv$-plane is the following rectangle:\n\n$$\nΔ={(u,v)\\,:\\,0\\le u\\le 1,\\,0\\le v\\le 1}\n$$\n\n![](images/5b/5be3ed729654d60b6084200334086b35f093e461bfa2f0eb9d8f0c323f007fb3.png)\n\n**Step 3**: Compute the Jacobian determinant corresponding to ${T}^{-1}:$\n\nThe Jacobian determinant corresponding to ${T}^{-1}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(u,v)}{∂(x,y)} & =|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂u}{∂x} & \\frac{∂u}{∂y} \\\\ \\frac{∂v}{∂x} & \\frac{∂v}{∂y}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Step 4**: Compute the Jacobian determinant corresponding to $T:$\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}={(\\frac{∂(u,v)}{∂(x,y)})}^{-1}=1\n$$\n\nNote that $\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}\\ne 0$ everywhere inside $Δ.$ In other words, $T$ has no critical points inside $Δ.$\n\n**Step 5**: Perform the change of variables, and evaluate the integral:\n\nPerforming the change of variables, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi (x+y))\\,\\text{d}x\\text{d}y & ={∬}_{Δ}u\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi v)\\,|\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}|\\,\\text{d}u\\text{d}v \\\\  & ={∬}_{Δ}u\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi v)\\,|1|\\,\\text{d}u\\text{d}v \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{1}u\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi v)\\,\\text{d}u\\,\\text{d}v \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi v)\\,\\text{d}v{\\int }_{0}^{1}u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & ={[-\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi v)}{\\pi }]}_{0}^{1}\\cdot {[\\frac{1}{2}{u}^{2}]}_{0}^{1}\\,\\text{d}v \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{\\pi }\\cdot \\frac{1}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373923 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373924 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373923 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373925 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373923 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373926 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373923 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373927 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373923 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373928 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373923 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373923 1077 "selection" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373923 1079 #edb/ref 17592186373928 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373923 1080 #uuid "95107d27-68cf-5739-8e44-f4226a672f34" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373924 1081 "2" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373924 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373924 1084 #uuid "790e8e07-7e51-507f-8184-c6e269fb8de8" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373925 1081 "\\pi " 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373925 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373925 1084 #uuid "e4fff2f8-8d95-5435-b189-10210d784148" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373926 1081 "\\frac{3}{2\\pi }" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373926 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373926 1084 #uuid "f14b4067-73c1-5f25-863f-0a6233383ceb" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373927 1081 "1" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373927 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373927 1084 #uuid "39736917-e30f-55c3-8963-53bb38f33eca" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373928 1081 "\\frac{1}{\\pi }" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186373928 1083 #edb/ref 1759218604