nding to $T:$\n\nThe Jacobian determinant corresponding to $T$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂(x,y,z)}{∂(u,v,w)}={(\\frac{∂(u,v,w)}{∂(x,y,z)})}^{-1}=6.\n$$\n\nNote that $\\frac{∂(x,y,z)}{∂(u,v,w)}\\ne 0$ everywhere inside $Δ.$ In other words, $T$ has no critical points inside $Δ.$\n\n**Step 4**: Perform the change of variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∭}_{R}(\\frac{2x-y}{2}+\\frac{z}{3})\\,dV & ={∭}_{Δ}(u+w)\\cdot |6|\\,\\text{d}u\\text{d}v\\text{d}w \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{1}\\,(6u+6w)\\,dw\\,dv\\,du \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{2}[6uw+3{w}^{2}]_{w=0}^{w=1}\\,dv\\,du \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{2}(6u(1-0)+3({1}^{2}-{0}^{2}))\\,dv\\,du \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{2}(6u+3)\\,dv\\,du \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(6u+3)[v]_{v=0}^{v=2}\\,du \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(6u+3)\\cdot 2\\,du \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(12u+6)\\,du \\\\  & =[6{u}^{2}+6u]_{u=0}^{u=1} \\\\  & =6({1}^{2}-{0}^{2})+6(1-0) \\\\  & =12\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374104 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374105 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374104 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374106 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374104 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374107 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374104 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374108 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374104 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374109 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374104 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374104 1077 "selection" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374104 1079 #edb/ref 17592186374105 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374104 1080 #uuid "77c9eaf7-9a6d-5842-bcbc-caffd6461b49" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374105 1081 "12" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374105 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374105 1084 #uuid "6bab9309-d8a5-51d1-807c-f4b9da8a32be" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [175