74 "Two sets $A$ and $B$ are *disjoint* if they have no element in common, i.e., their intersection is empty:\n\n$$\nA\\cap B=∅\n$$\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine our sets.\n\n- Pair I is disjoint. Indeed, the intersection of the sets is empty:\n\n$$\n{3,4,5}\\cap {6,7,8}=∅\\,\\,✓\n$$\n\n- Pair II is also disjoint. Indeed, the intersection of the sets is empty:\n\n$$\n{-4,-3,-2}\\cap {2,3,4}=∅\\,\\,✓\n$$\n\n- Pair III is *not* disjoint since the intersection of the sets is not empty:\n\n$$\n[-3,0]\\cap [0,3]={0}\\ne ∅\\,\\,\\times \n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only.\"" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374268 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374269 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374268 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374270 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374268 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374271 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374268 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374272 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374268 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374273 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374268 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374268 1077 "selection" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374268 1079 #edb/ref 17592186374272 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374268 1080 #uuid "ce7b2aa3-4c09-5d92-b3a7-10836c641729" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374269 1081 "I, II, and III" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374269 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374269 1084 #uuid "0fbad822-a55d-54b1-a8b2-602b7b51aef5" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374270 1081 "II and III only" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374270 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374270 1084 #uuid "dc63d538-6e7c-5e27-9165-dbb714b36dfa" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374271 1081 "I only" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374271 1083 #edb/ref 175921860455