17592186374537 1071 "Calculate the integral $\\int \\frac{9\\sqrt{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3x)}}{x}\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374537 1072 #uuid "9ee01988-486e-562a-9b69-5957be021102" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374537 1074 "Let's set $u=\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3x).$ Then, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{3x}\\cdot 3\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}u=\\frac{1}{x}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{9\\sqrt{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3x)}}{x}\\,\\text{d}x & =9\\int \\sqrt{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3x)}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x} \\\\  & =9\\int \\sqrt{u}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =9\\int {u}^{1/2}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =9\\cdot \\frac{2{u}^{3/2}}{3}+C \\\\  & =6{u}^{3/2}+C \\\\  & =6\\sqrt{{ln}^{3}⁡(3x)}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374538 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374539 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374538 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374540 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374538 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374541 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374538 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374542 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374538 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374543 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374538 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374538 1077 "selection" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374538 1079 #edb/ref 17592186374542 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374538 1080 #uuid "26fad09b-23ab-5b9a-8576-81bb56e1bd61" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374539 1081 "6\\sqrt{\\operatorname{ln}⁡(9x)}+C" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374539 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374539 1084 #uuid "129b807e-539b-5cac-a914-e2c7e71a90b8" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374540 1081 "6\\sqrt{{ln}^{2}⁡(3{x}^{2})}+C" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [