 (-3) \\\\  & =12-3x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting the dot product equal to $0,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\cdot b & =0 \\\\ 12-3x & =0 \\\\ -3x & =-12 \\\\ x & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374545 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374546 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374545 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374547 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374545 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374548 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374545 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374549 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374545 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374550 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374545 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374545 1077 "selection" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374545 1079 #edb/ref 17592186374549 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374545 1080 #uuid "af73e53b-f8ec-53d4-ad2f-688f3fcd26ab" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374546 1081 "3" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374546 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374546 1084 #uuid "10a6363d-50b7-53ee-9211-bf98b3b730c4" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374547 1081 "2" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374547 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374547 1084 #uuid "6d50033c-ac1e-5bc6-84ee-1d4b187400c2" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374548 1081 "1" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374548 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374548 1084 #uuid "2c9d11de-00b2-5f81-bbb0-9e2cfe2d24d2" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374549 1081 "4" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374549 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374549 1084 #uuid "4f93f9db-ba0a-508a-846f-8f31e1eda3c6" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374550 1081 "0" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true]