the tank.\n\nAs a result, the volume of brine in the tank after $t$ minutes is \n\n$$\n600+18t-12t=(600+6t)\\,\\text{L}.\n$$\n\nThen, since $Q$ is the amount of salt in the tank, the *concentration* of the brine at time $t$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{Q}{600+6t}\\,\\frac{\\text{kg}}{\\text{L}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, as the completely mixed brine leaves at a rate of $12\\,\\text{L/min},$ *salt* leaves at a rate of\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{Q}_{\\text{out}}^{′} & =(12\\,\\frac{\\text{L}}{\\text{min}})\\cdot (\\frac{Q}{600+6t}\\,\\frac{\\text{kg}}{\\text{L}}) \\\\  & =(12\\,\\frac{\\cancel{\\text{L}}}{\\text{min}})\\cdot (\\frac{Q}{600+6t}\\,\\frac{\\text{kg}}{\\cancel{\\text{L}}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{12Q}{600+6t}\\,\\frac{\\text{kg}}{\\text{min}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2Q}{100+t}\\,\\frac{\\text{kg}}{\\text{min}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Step 3**: Calculate the overall rate of change.\n\nThe rate of change equals the rate of entry minus the rate of exit. Therefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{dQ}{dt} & ={Q}_{\\text{in}}^{′}-{Q}_{\\text{out}}^{′} \\\\ \\frac{dQ}{dt} & =0-\\frac{2Q}{100+t} \\\\ \\frac{dQ}{dt} & =-\\frac{2}{100+t}\\,Q.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Step 4**: Integrate the equation.\n\nSeparating variables and integrating both sides with respect to $t,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{Q}\\cdot \\frac{dQ}{dt} & =-\\frac{2}{100+t} \\\\ \\int \\frac{1}{Q}\\cdot \\frac{dQ}{dt}dt & =\\int (-\\frac{2}{100+t})\\,dt \\\\ \\int \\frac{1}{Q}\\cdot \\,dQ & =-2\\int \\frac{1}{100+t}\\,dt \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡|Q| & =-2\\operatorname{ln}⁡|100+t|+C \\\\ |Q| & ={e}^{-2\\operatorname{ln}⁡|100+t|+C} \\\\ Q(t) & =\\frac{A}{(100+t)^{2}},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $A=\\pm {e}^{C}$ is a constant of integration.\n\nWe're told that the tank initially contains $25\\,\\text{kg}$ of salt. So, we can apply the initial condition $Q(0)=25,$ and solve for $A:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Q(0) & =25 \\\\ \\frac{A}{(100+0)^{2}} & =25 \\\\ A & =25\\cdot {100}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we obtain the following expression for $Q(t):$\n\n$$\nQ(t)=25{(\\frac{100}{100+t})}^{2}\n$$" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374833 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374834 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374833 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374835 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374833 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374836 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374833 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374837 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374833 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374838 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374833 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374833 1077 "selection" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374833 1079 #edb/ref 17592186374837 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374833 1080 #uuid "e5507560-e644-5b06-9ffc-b163d1f6589b" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374834 1081 "Q(t)=20{(\\frac{100}{100+t})}^{2}" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374834 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374834 1084 #uuid "587ad7eb-e7ff-5449-a3e7-315421a5c0c6" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374835 1081 "Q(t)=2500{(\\frac{10}{100+t})}^{2}" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374835 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374835 1084 #uuid "95d74708-bfdc-53f7-9971-439077d9c125" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374836 1081 "Q(t)=25\\frac{100}{(100+t)^{2}}" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374836 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374836 1084 #uuid "c1ca561d-2102-5596-b774-af92e2184dde" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374837 1081 "Q(t)=25{(\\frac{100}{100+t})}^{2}" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374837 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374837 1084 #uuid "28f84566-0022-5a52-aa79-a865a20593a8" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374838 1081 "Q(t)=20{(\\frac{10}{100+t})}^