}_{p}^{′}$ into the differential equation, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{″}+2{y}^{′}-3y & =g(x) \\\\ ({y}_{p}^{′})^{′}+2{y}_{p}^{′}-3{y}_{p} & =g(x)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing our expressions for ${y}_{p}$ and ${y}_{p}^{′},$ we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{({u}_{1}({e}^{x})^{′}+{u}_{2}({e}^{-3x})^{′})}^{′}+2({u}_{1}({e}^{x})^{′}+{u}_{2}({e}^{-3x})^{′})-3({u}_{1}{e}^{x}+{u}_{2}{e}^{-3x}) & =g(x) \\\\ {({u}_{1}{e}^{x}-3{u}_{2}{e}^{-3x})}^{′}+2{u}_{1}{e}^{x}-6{u}_{2}{e}^{-3x}-3{u}_{1}{e}^{x}-3{u}_{2}{e}^{-3x} & =g(x) \\\\ {u}_{1}^{′}{e}^{x}+{u}_{1}{e}^{x}-3{u}_{2}^{′}{e}^{-3x}+9{u}_{2}{e}^{-3x}+2{u}_{1}{e}^{x}-6{u}_{2}{e}^{-3x}-3{u}_{1}{e}^{x}-3{u}_{2}{e}^{-3x} & =g(x)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we group all terms proportional to ${u}_{1}$ and ${u}_{2}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{u}_{1}{{({e}^{x}+2{e}^{x}-3{e}^{x})}_{⏟}}_{0}+{u}_{2}{{(9{e}^{-3x}-6{e}^{-3x}-3{e}^{-3x})}_{⏟}}_{0}+{u}_{1}^{′}{e}^{x}-3{u}_{2}^{′}{e}^{-3x}=g(x)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that the expressions in parentheses are both zero. Therefore, the equation reduces to\n\n$$\n{u}_{1}^{′}{e}^{x}-3{u}_{2}^{′}{e}^{-3x}=g(x).\n$$" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374938 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374939 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374938 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374940 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374938 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374941 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374938 1075 #edb/ref 17592186374942 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374938 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374938 1077 "field-3" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374938 1079 #edb/ref 17592186374940 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374938 1080 #uuid "2daf61ca-2864-5046-9a57-41a4be211613" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374939 1081 "{u}_{1}^{′}{e}^{x}+{u}_{2}^{′}{e}^{-3x}={g}^{′}(x)" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186374939 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [175