1084 #uuid "4239cddb-b6b8-5fef-942d-0f2d09b43064" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375616 1081 "{\\sum }_{n=1}^{6}{2}^{n-1}" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375616 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375616 1084 #uuid "16b350b8-e26e-57c5-8c8b-90b312eece58" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375617 1068 #edb/ref 17592186375618 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375617 1069 "q-98712" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375617 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375617 1071 "![](images/12/127ce21273f015a6c6d94f7310d55752f0df59109d4eda6b124dcf30dbcd8a84.png)\n\nConsiderer the differential equation $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=f(y)$ where the graph of $f(y)$ is shown above. Which of the following statements are true?\n\n- $y=-1$ is a node.\n- $y=-1$ is a sink.\n- $y=3$ is a source." 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375617 1072 #uuid "e443c6c6-f36c-520d-8b6e-ac840237648e" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375617 1074 "We can classify the equilibrium solutions of an autonomous ODE ${y}^{′}=f(y)$ by examining its phase line.\n\n- An equilibrium solution is a *sink* if the arrows directly above and below it on the phase line both point *toward* the equilibrium solution.\n\n- An equilibrium solution is a *source* if the arrows directly above and below it on the phase line both point *away* from the equilibrium solution.\n\n- An equilibrium solution is a *node* if the arrows directly above and below it on the phase line point in the same direction.\n\nThe phase line that corresponds to the given graph is as follows:\n\n![](images/00/00b78ec1a61666d8c313593abeac98da1f2717b4db29ea4dca2c7e0e5c817f55.png)\n\nTherefore, we have:\n\n- Statement I is true while statement II is false. From the phase line, we see that $y=-1$ is a node.\n\n- Statement III is true. From the phase line, we see that $y=3$ is a source.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only\"." 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375618 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375619 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375618 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375620 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375618 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375621 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375618 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375622 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375618 1075 #edb/ref 17592186375623 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375618 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375618 1077 "selection" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375618 1079 #edb/ref 17592186375620 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375618 1080 #uuid "08fff4be-af86-5290-ac57-639c5cca766b" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375619 1081 "II and III only" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375619 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375619 1084 #uuid "e1f8fa5e-8357-5544-87e4-1fecf437e00d" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375620 1081 "I and III only" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375620 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375620 1084 #uuid "9a6438f3-2979-57f0-b1ed-e7628f47b207" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375621 1081 "I only" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375621 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375621 1084 #uuid "170e35af-d209-5a77-98fc-94f282e64001" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375622 1081 "III only" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375622 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375622 1084 #uuid "3c5f035c-5805-5c08-aaa1-170f9450487c" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375623 1081 "II only" 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375623 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533451 17592186045585 true] [17592186375623 1084 #uu